    "Terms of Service need to be accepted": {
      "API message": "Sprejeti je treba pogoje storitve"
    },
    "Terrain": "Teren",
    "Thanks to the statistical cookies provided by ourselves and other companies, we can evaluate the visit on our website and know the sources of traffic. Data we obtain help us understand what visitors like and improve our website. If you reject them, we cannot improve your experience.": "Zahvaljujoč statističnim in analitičnim piškotkom, ki jih zagotavljamo mi in druga podjetja, lahko ocenimo obisk naše spletne strani in poznamo vire prometa. Podatki, ki jih pridobimo, nam pomagajo razumeti, kaj je obiskovalcem všeč, in izboljšati naše spletno mesto. Če jih zavrnete, ne moremo izboljšati vaše izkušnje.",
    "The MRD method (beginner) is allowed when danger is 3 maximum. Choose another method: MRE or MRP.": "Metoda MRD (začetnik) je dovoljena s stopnjo nevarnosti največ 3. Izberite metodo MRE ali MRP.",
    "The hazard potential is calculated from the danger level of the avalanche bulletin. It can be fine-tuned by selecting a potential within the danger level’s corresponding range. For example: the avalanche bulletin evokes a danger 3 just after a period in danger 4. We can then indicate a hazard potential of 12 instead of 8.": "Potencial nevarnosti se izračuna iz stopnje nevarnosti plazovnega biltena. Lahko ga natančno nastavite z izbiro potenciala znotraj ustreznega območja stopnje nevarnosti. Na primer: plazovni bilten omenja nevarnost 3 takoj po obdobju v nevarnosti 4. Tako lahko navedemo potencial nevarnosti 12 namesto 8.",
    "The page you are looking for does not exist or is broken.": "Stran, ki jo iščete, ne obstaja ali pa je pokvarjena.",
    "The slope must be between 0 and 80 deg": "Naklon mora biti med 0 in 80 stopinj",
    "The slope must be between 50 and 3000m high": "Višina pobočja mora biti med 50 in 3000 m",
    "The “slope traveled frequently” factor is not taken into account by the application, as it is often difficult to ascertain when preparing for an outing.": "Aplikacija ne upošteva faktorja »znano pobočje«, ker ga je pri pripravi ture pogosto težko določiti.",
    "There are sensitive areas on this route. Please refer to the map.": "Ta smer prečka ali se nahaja v bližini občutljivih območij. Prosimo, oglejte si zemljevid.",
    "These are positive experiences that reveal usefull risk-management skills.": "Pozitivne izkušnje, ki razkrivajo uporabne veščine obvladovanja tveganj.",
    "These cookies allow you to interact from camptocamp.org website with social media modules and share content of the website with other people or let them know of your consultation or opinion on it, e.g. when you click on the &quot;Share&quot; module. By disabling these cookies, you won't be able to share content from camptocamp.org on social networks.": "Ti piškotki vam omogočajo interakcijo s spletnega mesta camptocamp.org z moduli družbenih medijev in deljenje vsebine spletnega mesta z drugimi osebami ali jih obveščati o vašem posvetovanju ali mnenju o tem, na primer ko kliknete na modul »Deli«. Če onemogočite te piškotke, ne boste mogli deliti vsebine s camptocamp.org na družbenih omrežjih.",
    "This book cover is the property of its editor and/or author": "Platnica te knjige je last njenega založnika in/ali avtorja",
    "This content is licensed under Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 3.0": "Ta vsebina je licencirana pod Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 3.0",
    "This content is licensed under Creative Commons BY-SA 3.0": "Ta vsebina je licencirana pod Creative Commons BY-SA 3.0",
    "This document is a draft.": "Ta dokument je osnutek.",
    "This field is too long": "Besedilo je predolgo",
    "This field is too short": "Besedilo je prekratko",
    "This field must be a valid ISBN.": {
      "API message": "To polje mora biti veljaven ISBN."
    },
    "This is an archived version of this page, as of": "To je arhivirana verzija dokumenta z datumom",
    "This is the first version": "To je prva verzija",
    "This is the last version": "To je zadnja verzija",
    "This is where you may describe the route extensively, maybe starting with a brief summary and then developing the description (including approach, descent, etc.). Don't forget to mention the route history if you know it.": "Tukaj lahko obširno opišete smer, morda začnete s kratkim povzetkom in nato razvijate opis (vključno s dostopom, sestopom itd.). Ne pozabite omeniti zgodovine smeri, če jo poznate.",
    "This picture depicts a book cover. It is the property of its editor and/or author. It is presented here only for illustration purposes.": "Ta slika prikazuje platnico knjige. Je last založnika in/ali avtorja. Tukaj je predstavljena samo za ilustracijo.",
    "This profile is only available to authenticated users.": "Ta profil je na voljo samo vpisanim uporabnikom.",
    "This tool estimates the technical difficulty of a ski route (ski rating).": "To orodje oceni tehnično težavnost smučarske ture (smučarska ocena).",
